utside that set (except the always-included files","-//!    handled in pass 3).","-//! 3. **Always-include** the standard files: `package.json`,","-//!    `README`, `COPYING`, and `LICEN[SC]E`, with any extension, at","-//!    the root, plus the paths declared in `main` / `browser` / `bin`. The packed","-//!    package's `package.yaml` / `package.json5` are included too, but","-//!    a bundled dependency's are not. These survive `.npmignore`","-//!    rejection and the `files`-field filter.","-//! 4. **`bundleDependencies` closure**: starting from the names in","-//!    `manifest.bundleDependencies` (or the legacy","-//!    `bundledDependencies`), transitively include every reachable","-//!    dependency. A bundled package pulls in its own `dependencies`","-//!    and `optionalDependencies` too, so the whole closure ships.","-//!    Each name is resolved with the node module-resolution walk-up","-//!    from the parent's real directory (nested `node_modules/` first,","-//!    then ancestor `node_modules/`), and packed where Node resolves","-//!    it from the parent's packed location.","-//!    Port of [`npm-bundled`](https://github.com/npm/npm-bundled).","+//! File selection uses one per-directory ignore rule stack. Manifest `files`","+//! rules replace root ignore files; required paths and standard package files","+//! are appended at the root. Bundled dependencies use the same selection."," ","-pub use files_field::build_files_matcher;","+pub use ignore_walk::files_field::{FilesMatcher, build_files_matcher};"," "," use derive_more::{Display, Error};","-use ignore::gitignore::Gitignore;","-use ignore_walk::{IgnoreFiles, walk_files};","+use ignore_walk::{PackageRules, walk_files};"," use pnpm_diagnostics::miette::{self, Diagnostic};"," use pnpm_package_manifest::safe_read_package_json_from_dir;"," use serde_json::Value;","@@ -69,11 +40,6 @@ pub enum PacklistError {","     },"," }"," ","-/// Lowercased stems of the files always-included at the package root","-/// r